<title>PHILIPPINES: Centro Escolar sets 5 peso cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Centro Escolar sets 5 peso cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centro Escolar University said on Wednesday its board had adopted a resolution to give a 5 peso cash dividend to stockholders as of November 29.</p>
<p>The payment date is set on December 18.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
